    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 14 Anchor Mews, an impressive first-floor apartment presented in excellent turnkey condition and ideally positioned within this exclusive, gated development at South Quay, Arklow. Comprising just 30 properties, Anchor Mews is a small and well-established boutique development, offering a sense of privacy and exclusivity in a highly convenient town-centre setting. No. 14 enjoys a bright and spacious interior, with well-proportioned accommodation providing a comfortable and contemporary living environment. Ideally located close to Arklow town centre and the waterfront, the property is within easy reach of an excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, leisure facilities and transport links. Combining the appeal of a secure and private residential setting with the convenience of town-centre living, No. 14 Anchor Mews represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a quality apartment in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented apartment combines contemporary design with well-proportioned and practical accommodation, complemented by high ceilings throughout. Accessed via a flight of steps, the property opens into a welcoming entrance hall, leading to an impressive open-plan living space. The bright and spacious living area benefits from excellent natural light and flows seamlessly into the galley-style kitchen, which is well appointed with an integrated electric oven and hob, together with ample storage. The main bedroom is generously proportioned and features two Velux windows, fitted wardrobes, a built-in bookshelf and carpet flooring. The second double bedroom is also well presented, with fitted wardrobes, a built-in bookshelf and oak laminate flooring. Completing the accommodation is a stylishly finished family bathroom, featuring a generous double walk-in shower, contemporary tiling and a bathroom heater light. Overall, the property offers bright, comfortable and well-appointed accommodation in a contemporary setting.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is situated within a well-maintained and highly regarded boutique development comprising just 30 town houses and apartments. The development offers a pleasant and private residential setting, with the property benefiting from its own designated parking space. The compact nature of the development adds to its appeal, providing a more intimate setting while remaining conveniently positioned close to Arklow town centre, the waterfront and a wide range of local amenities.\r\n\r\n14 Anchor Mews enjoys a convenient position at South Quay, within easy reach of Arklow town centre and the waterfront. The property is ideally placed to avail of the town’s wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and everyday amenities, with the coastal setting and Avoca river also close by. Arklow offers excellent transport connections, including regular rail services from Arklow railway station and easy access to the M11 motorway, providing convenient connectivity to Dublin, Wexford and surrounding areas. The location combines the convenience of town-centre living with the added benefit of Arklow’s attractive riverside and coastal setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nWelcoming hallway complimented by high ceilings \r\nLiving room & Kitchen \r\nBright open plan living room connecting to galley style kitchen. Contemporary kitchen with integrated oven & hob\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nSpacious double room, high ceilings, oak laminate floor, fitted wardrobes and bookshelf\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom, high ceilings, oak laminate floor, fitted wardrobes and bookshelf\r\nBathroom \r\nStylishly finished family bathroom, generous double walk-in shower, contemporary tiling and a bathroom heater light"
      },
      {
