        "Content": "Exquisite Waterfront Residence\r\nB Energy Efficiency\r\nBoutique Development nestled on South Quay, Arklow\r\nStunning 2 Bedroom Own Door 1st Floor Apartment \r\nExceptional contemporary Interior\r\nDesignated Parking Space\r\nManagement approximately €1430 Per Annum\r\nHighly regarded and mature neighbourhood \r\nLocated a short stroll from town centre and a host of amenities\r\nEasy access to Bus, Rail and the M11"
